NOTICE

This is an unofficial, independent reimplementation of Gobe Productive 2.0.1
for BeOS. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by Gobe Software
or whoever now holds the rights to Gobe Productive. "Gobe Productive" is a
trademark of its owners.

The port was written by studying how the original program behaves, including
analysis of its machine code, so that it reads and writes the same documents
and works the same way. It contains no code, resources, pictures, sample
documents or dictionaries from the original: it needs the user's own copy of
the original "Gobe Productive" program file and reads its menus, dialogs,
strings and pictures from it at runtime.

The legal status of the original's rights is unclear, and so is how far this
reimplementation may be affected by them. The MIT licence above applies only to
the extent that the contributors hold rights in this code. If you hold rights
to Gobe Productive and have a concern, please open an issue.
